        "peritoneum_floor_below_original_skin_m": 0.0,
        "peritoneum_floor_basis": "With the full 30 mm wall the inner surface reached 15 mm below the RCM and the PSM3 jaws touched it at the grasp point: the working cavity of this model lies just under the original skin. A 3 mm floor still let the PSM3 jaws touch it on the way to the grasp point. The inner surface is therefore kept no lower than the original skin, which every arm already clears: over the ports the wall is the 15 mm lift, the RCM lies 0-1.5 mm above the peritoneum, and the wall reaches 30 mm only where the dome lifts it further.",
